OL,3,GNEWSAAs it happened: Amy and Lindsey
OL,4,Acomplete Push for Pudsey challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmy Garcia and Lindsey Burrow have
OL,7,Fpushed the BBC Look North red sofa
OL,8,Facross Yorkshire for Children in Need
OL,10,FThe 80-mile Push for Pudsey got under
OL,11,Fway in Ripon on Monday and finished at
OL,12,Fthe Belle Vue stadium on Friday
OL,14,FAn estimated 1,000 people turned up in
OL,15,FOssett to greet them today, with the
OL,16,Fpair reaching Wakefield Trinity's
OL,17,Fstadium at about 18:40
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
